The '''colosseum scoreboard''' can be found on the inside of the [[Fortis Colosseum]] entrance. It can be viewed to see personal and global statistics for the Colosseum and the [[Glory]] from fighting within.

As of [[1 October]] [[2026]], the global best glory achieved is '''60,543''', and the best time is '''13:30.60'''. The total waves completed are '''146,722,332''', total [[Sol Heredit]] kills are '''1,956,370''', and the total deaths are '''13,786,647'''.

